# Update-signing private key material. The real files live outside this
# checkout (release/DesktopPrivate/, reachable as ../DesktopPrivate from here,
# which is what packer.cpp includes) and are regenerated by
# release/gen_private.sh. These patterns exist so that a stray copy dropped
# inside the repo cannot be committed by accident.
packer_private.h
alpha_private.h
DesktopPrivate/
*.pem
